  ["kotoba-lang/standard-model gains a new namespace kotoba.sm.gtg: the
    Gauge Theory Gravity (Lasenby-Doran-Gull 1998) ROTATION-GAUGE SECTOR ONLY --
    so(1,3) bivector generators T^ab=(i/4)[gamma^a,gamma^b] built from the
    existing kotoba.sm.spinor gamma matrices, handed to kotoba.sm.gauge's
    generic (not SU(2)/SU(3)-hardcoded) structure-constant/covariant-derivative/
